1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,574
Sync History tab mein aapko har sync ka record milta hai.

2
00:00:03,574 --> 00:00:08,403
Timestamp, kitne vouchers aaye, kaunsi tables update hui, koi error toh nahi.

3
00:00:08,403 --> 00:00:12,166
Green tick matlab successful, red exclamation matlab failed.

4
00:00:12,166 --> 00:00:15,302
Failed sync pe click kariye — error detail milega.

5
00:00:15,302 --> 00:00:19,566
Common issues — Tally band tha, network gaya, ya password galat tha.

6
00:00:19,566 --> 00:00:23,329
Retry button hai — dabaaein, agent turant fir se try karega.

7
00:00:23,329 --> 00:00:28,158
Agar bar bar fail ho raha hai WhatsApp par FLOWRA support ko screenshot bhejo

8
00:00:28,158 --> 00:00:29,664
team turant help karegi.
